{"step_index":98,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:14:26Z","thinking":"The user's instruction is clear: locate business registration numbers across all available sites. Identifying available sources is the first step; Bizno.net, a public corporate registry linking various government databases, appears to be a primary resource. This will likely involve querying Bizno.net for company information and then cross-referencing with Hometax, 통신판매업, and 지자체 인허가.\n\n\nConsidered expanding the search beyond Bizno.net to include the 공정거래위원회 (KFTC) and various job platforms like Saramin and JobKorea, as these sources often contain business registration details.  The `research` subagent could be helpful, but crafting a targeted Node.js script for direct scraping from specific sites might be faster.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test multi-source search across Bizno, Saramin, JobKorea, Catch","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nasync function testSources(companyName) {\n    console.log(`\\n================ Testing for: ${companyName} ================`);\n    \n    // 1. Bizno\n    try {\n        const bRes = await fetch('https://bizno.net/?query=' + encodeURIComponent(companyName), {\n            headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n        });\n        const bHtml = await bRes.text();\n        const bMatches = [];\n        const linkRegex = /<a\\s+href=\"\\/article\\/(\\d{10})\"[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/a>([\\s\\S]*?)(?=<a\\s+href=\"\\/article|\\n\\s*<div class=\"footer|\\$)/gi;\n        let lm;\n        while ((lm = linkRegex.exec(bHtml)) !== null) {\n            bMatches.push({\n                bizno: lm[1],\n                title: lm[2].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim(),\n                snippet: lm[3].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim().slice(0, 150)\n            });\n        }\n        console.log(`[Bizno] Found ${bMatches.length} results:`, bMatches);\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.log('[Bizno] Error:', e.message);\n    }\n\n    // 2. Saramin\n    try {\n        const sRes = await fetch('https://www.saramin.co.kr/zf_user/search/company?searchword=' + encodeURIComponent(companyName), {\n            headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n        });\n        const sHtml = await sRes.text();\n        console.log('[Saramin] Length:', sHtml.length, 'Contains results:', sHtml.includes('company_popup') || sHtml.includes('corp_name'));\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.log('[Saramin] Error:', e.message);\n    }\n\n    // 3. Catch\n    try {\n        const cRes = await fetch('https://www.catch.co.kr/Search/SearchList?SearchText=' + encodeURIComponent(companyName), {\n            headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)' }\n        });\n        const cHtml = await cRes.text();\n        console.log('[Catch] Length:', cHtml.length, 'Contains comp:', cHtml.includes('CompName') || cHtml.includes('company'));\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.log('[Catch] Error:', e.message);\n    }\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n    await testSources('모두싸인');\n    await testSources('케어닥');\n    await testSources('토탈소프트뱅크');\n    await testSources('블루호텔레코딩스튜디오');\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Test multi-source company search","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\test_multi_source.js","toolAction":"Test multi-source lookup","toolSummary":"Test multi-source lookup"}}]}
