{"step_index":117,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:15:03Z","thinking":"Exploring additional resources for business registration numbers, specifically focusing on Korean companies. `bizno.net` appears promising, having successfully retrieved numbers for previous test cases like 모두싸인, 케어닥, and 토탈소프트뱅크. Also considering `ftc.go.kr` as a potential source for this information.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Test Daum and Google/Naver search for business numbers","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"async function testDaumSearch(name, ceo, addr) {\n    const query = `${name} 부산 ${ceo || ''} 사업자등록번호`.trim();\n    console.log('Searching Daum:', query);\n    try {\n        const url = 'https://search.daum.net/search?w=tot&q=' + encodeURIComponent(query);\n        const res = await fetch(url, {\n            headers: {\n                'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\n            }\n        });\n        const html = await res.text();\n        const bizNumbers = html.match(/\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}\\b/g);\n        console.log('Biz numbers found on Daum:', bizNumbers);\n        const text = html.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ').replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n        // print any snippet containing 사업자\n        const matches = text.match(/.{0,50}\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}.{0,50}/g);\n        if (matches) {\n            console.log('Matches:', matches.slice(0, 3));\n        }\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.log('Error:', e.message);\n    }\n}\n\ntestDaumSearch('모두싸인', '', '센텀스카이비즈');\ntestDaumSearch('블루호텔레코딩스튜디오', '김현', '장전동');\ntestDaumSearch('89Light', '', '충렬대로');\n","Description":"Test Daum search for company business numbers","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\test_daum.js","toolAction":"Test Daum search","toolSummary":"Test Daum search"}}]}
