{"step_index":140,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T00:15:48Z","thinking":"Found a match between the Naver query's third result and a CSV entry for \"에어딩동\" (Airdingdong). The Naver result includes the business registration number and the fact that it is associated with Dong-A University. The CSV provides an address that also appears to correspond to Dong-A University.\n\n\nThe business registration number's checksum is verified as valid. Utilizing Naver and Bizno.net searches, combined with other potential Korean search engines, will provide comprehensive business data. A multi-step verification pipeline will be used, checking company names, addresses, and representative matches against available data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Multi-source crawler and verifier for 421 missing companies","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\nconst path = require('path');\n\nconst SCRATCH_DIR = 'C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\scratch';\nconst missingFile = path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'missing_421.json');\nconst resultsFile = path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'verified_results.json');\n\nconst missing = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(missingFile, 'utf8'));\n\n// Load existing progress if available\nlet progress = {};\nif (fs.existsSync(resultsFile)) {\n    try {\n        progress = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(resultsFile, 'utf8'));\n        console.log(`Loaded existing progress with ${Object.keys(progress).length} entries.`);\n    } catch (e) {\n        console.log('Starting fresh progress.');\n    }\n}\n\n// 1. Checksum validation (국세청 표준 체크섬 공식)\nfunction isValidBizNo(b) {\n    if (!b) return false;\n    const clean = b.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    if (clean.length !== 10) return false;\n    const weights = [1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 7, 1, 3, 5];\n    let sum = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n        sum += Number(clean[i]) * weights[i];\n    }\n    const d9 = Number(clean[8]) * 5;\n    sum += Math.floor(d9 / 10) + (d9 % 10);\n    const check = (10 - (sum % 10)) % 10;\n    return check === Number(clean[9]);\n}\n\nfunction formatBizNo(b) {\n    const clean = b.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n    return `${clean.slice(0, 3)}-${clean.slice(3, 5)}-${clean.slice(5)}`;\n}\n\nfunction cleanName(name) {\n    if (!name) return '';\n    return name.replace(/\\(주\\)|주식회사|㈜|\\(유\\)|유한회사|\\(재\\)|재단법인|\\(사\\)|사단법인/g, '')\n               .replace(/[\\s\\-_.,]/g, '')\n               .to